- heresy-mixer.js: S.buses.subs, subStrip, subAdd/subSet/subDel, the graph's bus lanes (input, EQ, the kernel's compressor, fader, width, pan, mute) and the members wired into them, meters, the value's buses, undo across a change of members; edits: liveCuts, laid stretches fetched and crossfaded over the lane, drawn with their wave, Shift-drag picks, Ctrl+C/X/V, Delete, Esc, a right-click takes a laid stretch away
